From 515e0dc32a193527f4efee8fc729d4c68c217ba6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Knightly <J__A__K@hotmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Dec 2024 23:27:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 61/89] media: exynos4-is: Fix mipi-csis entity type

Enable resolutions and formats to be shown in `media-ctl -p`, to help with
constructing valid media pipelines:

Before:
```
- entity 17: s5p-mipi-csis.0 (2 pads, 5 links)
             type Node subtype V4L flags 0
             device node name /dev/v4l-subdev2
	pad0: SINK
		<- "S5C73M3-OIF":2 [ENABLED,IMMUTABLE]
	pad1: SOURCE
		-> "FIMC.0":0 []
		-> "FIMC.1":0 []
		-> "FIMC-LITE.0":0 []
		-> "FIMC-LITE.1":0 []
```
After:
```
- entity 17: s5p-mipi-csis.0 (2 pads, 5 links, 0 routes)
             type V4L2 subdev subtype Unknown flags 0
             device node name /dev/v4l-subdev2
	pad0: SINK
		[stream:0 fmt:VYUY8_2X8/1536x864]
		<- "S5C73M3-OIF":2 [ENABLED,IMMUTABLE]
	pad1: SOURCE
		[stream:0 fmt:VYUY8_2X8/1536x864]
		-> "FIMC.0":0 []
		-> "FIMC.1":0 []
		-> "FIMC-LITE.0":0 []
		-> "FIMC-LITE.1":0 []
```
Suggested-by: Laurent Pinchart <laurent.pinchart@ideasonboard.com>
Signed-off-by: Jack Knightly <J__A__K@hotmail.com>
---
 drivers/media/platform/samsung/exynos4-is/mipi-csis.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/samsung/exynos4-is/mipi-csis.c b/drivers/media/platform/samsung/exynos4-is/mipi-csis.c
index 452880b53..a8ffd91fe 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/samsung/exynos4-is/mipi-csis.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/samsung/exynos4-is/mipi-csis.c
@@ -849,7 +849,7 @@ static int s5pcsis_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	state->format.width = S5PCSIS_DEF_PIX_WIDTH;
 	state->format.height = S5PCSIS_DEF_PIX_HEIGHT;
 
-	state->sd.entity.function = MEDIA_ENT_F_IO_V4L;
+	state->sd.entity.function = MEDIA_ENT_F_VID_IF_BRIDGE;
 	state->pads[CSIS_PAD_SINK].flags = MEDIA_PAD_FL_SINK;
 	state->pads[CSIS_PAD_SOURCE].flags = MEDIA_PAD_FL_SOURCE;
 	ret = media_entity_pads_init(&state->sd.entity,
-- 
2.53.0

